Package: mlh-ibus
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, ibus, libswiftlang (>= 6.1.3)
Recommends: ibus-gtk3, ibus-gtk4
Description: modeless Japanese input method for IBus
 mlh converts text immediately before the cursor using slash commands.
 It uses the azooKey dictionary for kana-kanji conversion and supports
 Wayland applications through IBus.
